  "reason": "Initial persisted scan-index format and recipe 1. The bounded representation records declarations, offsets, exact ordering proof, bounds and damage facts without decoded values. A fresh full-content SHA-256 proof admits restoration; missing, malformed or ineligible indexes use the unchanged fresh scan. This baseline covers the serializer, cache/load owners, reader coordinates, file identity and scan interpretation. Final ownership review preserves explicit new reads after shutdown through a generation fence, rechecks source eligibility after encoding, and separates source refusals from optional cache I/O; decoded scan facts and REV algorithms remain unchanged.",
